# BIND-DAG: {{^    L[0-9]+: }}call valuetype [FakeRuntime]System.Runtime.InteropServices.GCHandle(native int) [FakeRuntime]System.Runtime.InteropServices.GCHandle::'FromIntPtr'{{$}}
