## A -shared library: the exported function, not the stub, on a host
## triple and on msil64-unknown-dotnet (an object, and bitcode through LTO).
## Each library is written as lib.dll (msil64-unknown-dotnet's in lib-net/
## and lib-lto/), so its export class is 'lib'.
